> should he be looking (maybe wishing) for?

	Stormbringer or one of the Brands.

	I wouldn't consider it a major priority, though, certainly not
worth burning a wish on. Magicbane is not a great melee weapon, but with
the Eye and a decent combat spell or two, you don't really need a good
melee weapon until you pick up the Amulet. If you're sacrificing to get
your prayer timeout down so you can #pray for spellbooks and a good
artifact falls out, use it, but don't bother working for it.

	You might #name Orcrist and Sting (but, for Anhur's sake, don't
*use* the pieces of junk)... this will both reduce the chances that
you'll get an artifact weapon instead of being able to #pray for
spellbooks, and increase the chances that it'll be a weapon that doesn't
suck if you are given one (elven non-wizards can guarantee that
Stormbringer will be their first gift that way).

